    {
      "id": "p2-formula-position",
      "eyebrow": "误区1",
      "title": "自我学习在哪一层?",
      "content": {
        "kind": "formula",
        "items": [
          "🔄 跨层的反馈回路",
          "🔍 Eval 层 - 照出问题",
          "发现规律(你是谁)",
          "💾 Scaffolding 层 - 固化教训",
          "更新 skill / 改 prompt / 写 memory"
        ],
        "conclusion": "它不是单独一层,而是连接 Eval 和 Scaffolding 的回路"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "很多人一开始会想,自我学习是不是单独一层?",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p2-formula-position-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "答案可能会让你意外,它不在任何单独一层。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p2-formula-position-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "它是从 Eval 层流回 Scaffolding 层的反馈回路。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p2-formula-position-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "在 Eval 层,评测会照出问题。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p2-formula-position-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "你发现规律,然后在 Scaffolding 层固化教训。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p2-formula-position-s4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "更新的内容可以是新 skill、改 prompt、或者写 memory。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p2-formula-position-s5.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "记住,自我学习是跨层的,不是独立的。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p2-formula-position-s6.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "fragments": [
