    {
      "id": "p3-duo-misconceptions",
      "eyebrow": "误区2",
      "title": "学到的内容放哪?",
      "content": {
        "kind": "duo",
        "left": {
          "title": "❌ 误区",
          "tag": "以为只有一种抽屉",
          "body": "学到的教训**统统写进 system prompt**"
        },
        "right": {
          "title": "✓ 正解",
          "tag": "按类型选抽屉",
          "body": "system prompt 是最常用的,但不是唯一的。\n\n教训类型不同,存放位置不同:\n\n- **策略级** → system prompt\n- **流程级** → 新 skill\n- **经验级** → memory\n- **规则级** → tool"
        }
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "第二个坑,很多人以为学到的内容就是要写进 system prompt。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p3-duo-misconceptions-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "system prompt 确实是最常用的抽屉,但不是唯一的。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p3-duo-misconceptions-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "你得看教训的类型来选抽屉。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p3-duo-misconceptions-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "策略级的教训,像角色定位、输出格式,这些放 system prompt。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p3-duo-misconceptions-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "流程级的,比如完成某个任务的步骤,这些可以封装成新 skill。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p3-duo-misconceptions-s4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "经验级的,像之前遇到什么特殊情况,存到 memory 里就行。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p3-duo-misconceptions-s5.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "规则级的,比如必须遵守的约束,写成 tool 更可靠。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p3-duo-misconceptions-s6.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "别把所有东西都塞进 system prompt,它会变臃肿的。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p3-duo-misconceptions-s7.mp3"
        }
      ],
