    {
      "id": "p5-formula-who",
      "eyebrow": "核心纠偏",
      "title": "\"自我学习\"到底是谁在学?",
      "content": {
        "kind": "formula",
        "items": [
          "agent 跑完任务 → 清零(无状态)",
          "你查看 Eval → 发现规律",
          "你固化教训 → 更新 Scaffolding",
          "下次 agent 开局 → 带着更新过的配置",
          "看起来\"更强\"了"
        ],
        "conclusion": "真正在学习的是你(开发者),agent 只是带着你的更新在跑"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "第三个坑,也是最重要的一个。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p5-formula-who-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "很多人以为 agent 会在运行中自己学习、自己进化。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p5-formula-who-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "但真相是,agent 跑完一个任务就啥也没记住了,它的状态会清零。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p5-formula-who-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "真正在学习的是你,是开发者。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p5-formula-who-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "你会查看 Eval 的评测结果,发现规律。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p5-formula-who-s4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "然后你把规律固化进 Scaffolding,更新 skill、prompt 或者 memory。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p5-formula-who-s5.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "下次 agent 开局的时候,带着的就是你更新过的配置。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p5-formula-who-s6.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "所以它看起来\"更强\"了,但真正在学习的是你。",
          "audio": "audio/self-learning-loop/p5-formula-who-s7.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "fragments": [
